WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.432 --> 00:00:03.491
- I definitely forgot that she snorted.

00:00:03.491 --> 00:00:05.332
I was like ohh! (chuckles)

00:00:06.252 --> 00:00:08.022
(melodious music)

00:00:10.752 --> 00:00:12.544
I was 12 years old when I met her.

00:00:12.544 --> 00:00:15.545
- We talked for maybe two
or three hours, over A-I-M,

00:00:15.545 --> 00:00:17.519
when he asked me to be
his girlfriend. (laughs)

00:00:17.519 --> 00:00:19.841
- I used to get off at 1:40
and go visit her at school.

00:00:19.841 --> 00:00:21.550
- I thought I was a big nerd.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:23.706
He seemed like a really
cool skater boy. (laughs)

00:00:26.246 --> 00:00:27.782
It was Danny's first kiss!

00:00:27.782 --> 00:00:31.017
- We-we went under the air
hockey table and it happened.

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.004
- I felt, great.

00:00:33.004 --> 00:00:33.932
I really liked Danny.

00:00:33.932 --> 00:00:35.546
- Like the puppy love, kind of thing.

00:00:37.816 --> 00:00:39.085
- Danny and I broke up because

00:00:39.085 --> 00:00:40.990
he liked another girl and I could tell.

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:42.520
- I feel bad about the breakup because

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:46.589
a week after I broke up, I
got with my next girlfriend.

00:00:47.269 --> 00:00:49.290
- I guess today, I'm pretty nervous.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:51.570
But I also think it's just a kiss.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.555
- Reenacting a first kiss, that's weird.

00:00:56.755 --> 00:00:58.500
- He's like laughing already, right?

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.782
This how you thought you'd
see me again? (laughs)

00:01:00.782 --> 00:01:01.409
Can you fit?

00:01:01.409 --> 00:01:02.494
You're too big.

00:01:02.494 --> 00:01:03.280
What's this?

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:04.506
- It's a tattoo.

00:01:04.506 --> 00:01:06.756
(laughs and snorts)

00:01:06.756 --> 00:01:08.248
- I have gla-- (laughs)

00:01:09.518 --> 00:01:11.738
Can I take off my glasses?
- [Maia] Yes.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.738
Why were we underneath the table?

00:01:13.738 --> 00:01:15.787
- I don't know, you took me there.

00:01:15.787 --> 00:01:17.779
- No, you went under first.

00:01:17.779 --> 00:01:19.020
Probably, I have no idea.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:19.925
I don't remember.

00:01:19.925 --> 00:01:20.902
- You did everything.

00:01:20.902 --> 00:01:21.957
- I did everything? (chuckles)

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:22.967
- You took my innocence.

00:01:22.967 --> 00:01:24.082
- We have to kiss soon I think.

00:01:24.082 --> 00:01:24.961
- I know!

00:01:24.961 --> 00:01:26.125
- Come here darling.

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:28.508
You look scared, don't look scared.

00:01:28.508 --> 00:01:29.814
Wait, this is how it was.

00:01:30.964 --> 00:01:32.546
- [Danny] I don't remember...
- This must have been how

00:01:32.546 --> 00:01:33.717
- [Maia] it was.
- You just like did it.

00:01:33.717 --> 00:01:34.500
- Did I really?

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:35.539
(both laugh)

00:01:35.539 --> 00:01:37.305
- Please, please, just come here.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:39.975
(stammers)

00:01:39.975 --> 00:01:41.514
- Okay.
- [Danny] Three, two...

00:01:43.754 --> 00:01:44.776
- There we did it.

00:01:44.776 --> 00:01:45.802
- Oh my God.

00:01:45.802 --> 00:01:47.863
- It was just a kiss, right?

00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:48.765
What?

00:01:48.765 --> 00:01:50.571
- Yeah, I know. I know, it was.

00:01:51.951 --> 00:01:53.301
Yeah, it was just a kiss.

00:01:53.301 --> 00:01:54.137
(laughs)

00:01:54.997 --> 00:01:56.534
I don't know.

00:01:57.474 --> 00:01:59.117
It feels...

00:01:59.117 --> 00:02:00.302
- When was the last time you saw me?

00:02:00.782 --> 00:02:01.939
- Like two years ago.

00:02:01.939 --> 00:02:03.900
We hung out but we didn't kiss.

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:06.318
- I said you were cool.

00:02:06.318 --> 00:02:08.543
I forgot you were also shy. (laughs)

00:02:08.543 --> 00:02:09.833
- Is that what you told them?

00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:11.017
(both laugh)

00:02:11.017 --> 00:02:12.510
- He's a really cool guy.

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.302
- Can we hang out again ever?

00:02:14.302 --> 00:02:16.019
- Yeah.
- [Maia] Yeah.

00:02:16.019 --> 00:02:17.773
- It's not weird, hanging out with you.

00:02:17.773 --> 00:02:18.841
- Yeah, it's not weird.

00:02:19.771 --> 00:02:20.793
- Hi.
- [Maia] Hi!

00:02:20.793 --> 00:02:22.440
Now we're...(laughs)

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.380
Okay, we can hug.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.954
- She's always been like a goofball.

00:02:27.954 --> 00:02:30.549
- Feeling old jokes pop up in my head.

00:02:30.549 --> 00:02:32.779
Just by seeing him, that
was like the most fun part.

00:02:32.789 --> 00:02:34.982
- I guess we've kind of
grown with each other.

00:02:34.982 --> 00:02:36.161
- Yeah, I missed Danny.

00:02:36.161 --> 00:02:37.967
Not too much in a couple way.

00:02:37.967 --> 00:02:40.498
- Well, I missed her as a friend.

00:02:40.498 --> 00:02:41.771
Yeah, she was cool.

00:02:41.771 --> 00:02:44.438
Everytime we meet up, it's kind
of like I saw her yesterday

00:02:44.438 --> 00:02:45.252
or something.

00:02:45.252 --> 00:02:46.773
- It did feel like a lot
like a best friendship.

00:02:46.773 --> 00:02:49.310
I think that kind of has followed me

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.959
in relationships I've
had since being younger.

00:02:51.959 --> 00:02:54.010
Maybe Danny started that a little bit.

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:55.969
- It was cool, it was fun.

00:02:55.969 --> 00:02:57.499
I'd do it again. (laughs)

